        "instruction": {
          "title": "Locate the Four Valves",
          "description": "Identify valves separating chambers: tricuspid and mitral/bicuspid (atrium \u2194 ventricle), plus pulmonary and aortic (ventricles \u2194 arteries). Notice where each valve sits relative to the flow direction."
        },
